---
title: Quote Extraction Data Flow
---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant CLI as 🔷 aqe CLI
    participant D as 📄 Docling
    participant W as 🔍 Weaviate
    participant C as 🤖 Claude
    participant DB as 💾 SQLite

    Note over U,DB: INGEST PHASE
    U->>CLI: aqe ingest ./papers/
    CLI->>D: POST /v1/convert (PDF)
    D-->>CLI: DoclingDocument JSON
    CLI->>CLI: HierarchicalChunker
    CLI->>W: Store chunks + embeddings
    CLI->>DB: Store chunks (verbatim text)
    CLI-->>U: ✓ Ingested 5 documents, 234 chunks

    Note over U,DB: EXTRACT PHASE
    U->>CLI: aqe extract "social media polarization"
    CLI->>W: Hybrid search (BM25 + vector)
    W-->>CLI: Top 50 chunks with metadata
    
    CLI->>C: Prompt: Topic + Chunks
    Note right of C: Claude analyzes relevance<br/>Returns chunk IDs only<br/>NO generated quote text
    C-->>CLI: Selected chunk IDs + explanations
    
    CLI->>DB: Lookup chunk IDs
    DB-->>CLI: Verbatim text + page numbers
    CLI->>CLI: Format Harvard references
    CLI->>DB: Save extraction
    CLI-->>U: ✓ Found 12 relevant quotes

    Note over U,DB: EXPORT PHASE
    U->>CLI: aqe export 1 --format markdown
    CLI->>DB: Get extraction + quotes
    DB-->>CLI: Full quote records
    CLI-->>U: quotes.md with citations
